Kick Starter Kit - CC0 1.0 Universal (Public Domain Dedication)

This dedication covers the generator script make_starter_kit.py and everything it writes: the
audio files (samples/Kit/, samples/Instruments/, samples/Loops/, samples/Metronome/), the
"Starter Kit" demo project and thumbnail in demos/Starter Kit/, and the Projects-screen tile in
recent_project/. All of it was synthesised from scratch by the script: fixed-seed noise and
oscillators, envelopes and filters written in plain Python. No recordings, sample libraries or
third-party sounds were used. Run the script again to regenerate identical files.

To the extent possible under law, the contributors have waived all copyright and related or
neighboring rights to the script and these files. They are dedicated to the public domain
under the Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal Public Domain Dedication:

    https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

You can copy, modify, distribute and use them, including for commercial purposes, without
asking permission and without attribution.

The files are provided "as is", without warranty of any kind.
